{"id":"12244785b4933273","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-cofinal-map.md","title":"ZFC Cofinal Map","display":"df-zfc-cofinal-map — ZFC Cofinal Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cofinal-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cofinal-map"],"display":"df-zfc-cofinal-map — ZFC Cofinal Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cofinal-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cofinal-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cofinal-map — ZFC Cofinal Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\kappa\">\\(\\lambda,\\kappa\\)</span> (ordinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\lambda\\to\\kappa\">\\(f:\\lambda\\to\\kappa\\)</span> (map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> (ordinal order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{CofinalMap}_S(f,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\exists\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\;(\\alpha\\leq f(\\xi))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{CofinalMap}_S(f,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\exists\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\;(\\alpha\\leq f(\\xi))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>Non-strict domination is required at successor targets: the constant map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\to1\">\\(1\\to1\\)</span> is cofinal, whereas the former strict inequality incorrectly rejected it.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ordinal}$ and $\\mathrm{Function}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]] and [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ordinal}$ and $\\mathrm{Function}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]] and [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda,\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\lambda\\to\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CofinalMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{CofinalMap}_S(f,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;\\exists\\xi<\\lambda\\;(\\alpha\\leq f(\\xi))","display":true},{"tex":"1\\to1","display":false}],"bytes":1048,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1626","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-cofinal-map.md|58-df-zfc-cofinal-map]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5582a281f15a33c2","36d7463d215be751"]}